# Worker Node Static Pod Provisioning

Configure a worker node's kubelet to manage a static pod without API server intervention and expose it via Services.

## Official Exam References & Quick Lookups

### Permitted Exam Documentation

- **Create Static Pods**: [Create Static Pods](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/configure-pod-container/static-pod/) `[EXAM ALLOWED]`
- **kubelet Configuration**: [kubelet Configuration](https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/config-api/kubelet-config.v1beta1/) `[EXAM ALLOWED]`

